id: pm-jev-nl5n
title: Release version replacement updates a comment instead of the exported extension identity
description: "GH issue #68: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jev/issues/68 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-29T13:44:57Z · updated 2026-10-29T13:44:57Z"
